# water.fmat — the animated water surface, as a material.
#
# This was a sector's `water:` block: six numbers filled in per surface, and no
# way to give two ponds the same swell without typing them twice. Put a brush
# face on this instead and it is water.
#
# The numbers here are the engine's own defaults spelled out, so that the file
# is a worked example rather than an empty one. Delete a line to take that
# parameter back to the default it already equals.
kind: surface
texture: water
doc: Still water — a pond, a flooded basin. Put it on a flat face.
effects:
  - effect: water
    wave_amplitude: 0.06
    wave_length: 3
    wave_speed: 0.35
    reflectivity: 0.45
    reflect_color: {r: 0.55, g: 0.72, b: 0.92}
